  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Thursday 22 October 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nSet on an 868m² freehold site, this property presents an exciting opportunity for developers, investors or families looking to secure a generous multi-entrance section with future potential.\r\n\r\nFor family home buyers, the property offers plenty of space to enjoy as it is. The large grounds feature established fruit trees and native planting, creating a private and practical outdoor setting with room for children, pets and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe existing home offers three bedrooms, one bathroom, a separate rumpus room and a double garage, providing comfortable family living or rental potential while future plans are considered.\r\n\r\nThere is also ample off-street parking, with plenty of space for the cars, boat, trailer and all the toys.\r\n\r\nA key advantage is the presence of underground wastewater and stormwater services located on site, adding further appeal for those exploring development options.\r\n\r\nWith established services and a highly desirable location within the Rangitoto College zone, this is an opportunity with plenty of options for today and tomorrow.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n• 868m² freehold site\r\n\r\n• Development potential\r\n\r\n• Underground wastewater and stormwater services located on site\r\n\r\n• Three bedrooms and one bathroom\r\n\r\n• Separate rumpus room\r\n\r\n• Double garage\r\n\r\n• Multi-entrance section\r\n\r\n• Ample off-street parking for cars, boats, trailers and more\r\n\r\n• Zoned for Rangitoto College",
